icism of Chinese…"],["Cycle or hike on SWBC","activity",3.13622,101.69431,"","","","","","r","If you need a break from the city hustle and bustle then try this: Walk or cycle on the Mid Valley-Dataran Merdeka Bike Lane, which was inaugurated in 2015. You can venture either towards the Mid Valley shopping mall (the largest in KL)…"],["Jaya Restoran","restaurant",3.13188,101.68769,"Jalan Thambipillay 47","07:00-23:00","","","","r","Great selection of Indian dishes. Very fresh ingredients. Especially the lunch buffet is highly recommended."],["Kuala Lumpur Railway Station","sight",3.13944,101.69333,"","","","","","r","A Moorish-style masterpiece designed by Arthur Benison Hubback, a British Architectural Assistant to the Director of Public Works. As well as suburban trains and express trains to Ipoh, it houses a mini-museum of Malaysian railway…"]]}